## YAML Documentation Convention

Add a comment block above `mana-cost` in every ability's tier-configuration:

```yaml
# Balance: Light bucket (combat/mobility)
# Design target: T1=30 (3 casts from full), T5=16 (6 casts from full)
mana-cost: "34 - (3.5 * tier)"
```

